== Notes ==

* Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* The bonus damage (reported as [[magical damage]]) is from a [[damage increase]] effect, so it ignores both [[damage resistance]] and damage [[immunity]].
* Caster level is increased by one when calculating the bonuses (but not the duration), causing this spell to be better than ''[[magic fang]]'' from the first level it is obtainable.
* This spell displaces earlier castings of itself and of ''magic fang''.

